        "descriptionModule": {
          "briefSummary": "The purpose of the study is to evaluate whether a caffeine-based cream can reduce the rates of reconstructive complications in patients with tissue expander based reconstruction requiring post-mastectomy radiation therapy when compared to a placebo cream."
        },
        "conditionsModule": {
